sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Streamlit UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant G as LangGraph agents
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant CH as Chroma + BM25
    participant L as Groq LLM

    U->>UI: types a question
    UI->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/chat/stream
    API->>G: run one turn (user_id, session_id)
    G->>PG: load chat history + summary + user facts
    G->>L: understand · rewrite · plan search
    G->>CH: hybrid search (semantic + keyword)
    CH-->>G: top 5 chunks
    G->>L: write answer with citations
    G-->>UI: stream answer tokens (via API)
    G->>PG: save new state, user facts, turn record
    API-->>UI: done: sources, intent, latency
    UI-->>U: answer + sources
